# Memory & cleanup (portfolio / React)

When writing or reviewing `useEffect`, scroll handlers, video, or motion:

- Clear every `setTimeout` / `setInterval` in effect cleanup.
- Remove every `addEventListener` in cleanup; handle `hashchange` like in `app/page.tsx`.
- `IntersectionObserver` / `ResizeObserver` → `disconnect()` on unmount.
- Cancel `requestAnimationFrame` when used.
- Video: pause and drop refs on unmount where components mount many clips (art gallery).
- Framer Motion: avoid leaving global document listeners outside React lifecycle.

Do not add Pixi/canvas game patterns — not used on this site.
